              : 'Apply online for Income Certificate, Caste, PAN Card, Ayushman Card, Land Records, and Utility Bills with real-time tracking.'}
          </p>

          {/* Quick Action Bar */}
          <div className="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
            <a
